MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialText_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7673b1263cd3fd34ba38962931034b66, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1062699008
    m_Localized: Welcome. This is the network map. Break into the rooms (layers)
      one after another; get through the last one to clear the story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1146585088
    m_Localized: This is the room you are in. Win its battle to move on to the next
      room. If you lose, you receive support tokens and can try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973696
    m_Localized: This shows how deep you are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973697
    m_Localized: Check the next opponent's traits and commands in Enemy Info.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973698
    m_Localized: When you are ready, press Connect to start the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973699
    m_Localized: Command Build lets you rebuild your deck from the commands you own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973700
    m_Localized: Tokens are your currency. You earn them from battle rewards and
      more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973701
    m_Localized: At the Market, spend tokens on chips (bundles of commands) or on
      single commands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973702
    m_Localized: Upgrade raises your max HP and max memory with tokens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973703
    m_Localized: You can replay this tutorial with this button at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973704
    m_Localized: Now let's learn the controls in a practice battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973705
    m_Localized: A practice battle. Combine commands and bring the enemy's HP down
      to zero to win.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973706
    m_Localized: This is the enemy. Below its name are its HP and what it will do
      on its next turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973707
    m_Localized: This is your unit. You lose if its HP runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973708
    m_Localized: 'The buffer: the commands you can use this turn. You draw them from
      your deck every turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973709
    m_Localized: 'Memory: loading a command uses up its cost (the number at its top
      left). It refills every turn.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1154973710
    m_Localized: Click Attack to load it into the command memory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168000
    m_Localized: Loaded commands run in order from 0x00 when you execute. Click a
      loaded command to take it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168001
    m_Localized: Block raises a wall that stops attack damage. Load it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168002
    m_Localized: Regeneration is a lasting effect that restores HP at the end of
      every turn. Load it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168003
    m_Localized: Commands you lack the memory for are darkened, with their cost in
      magenta. You can't load them now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168004
    m_Localized: Execute runs the loaded commands in order and ends your turn. Press
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168005
    m_Localized: 'The enemy infected you with a virus: a lasting effect that deals
      damage at the end of each turn, while Regeneration heals you. Effects on you
      are listed under your HP.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168006
    m_Localized: Used commands and the unused buffer go to the archive at the end
      of each turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168007
    m_Localized: Every turn you draw from the deck into the buffer. When the deck
      runs out, the archive is shuffled back into it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168008
    m_Localized: Heal restores HP. Load it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168009
    m_Localized: Mining costs HP but raises the tokens you win. It is purged once
      used. Load it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168010
    m_Localized: Now execute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168011
    m_Localized: Purged commands go here and do not come back for the rest of this
      battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1159168012
    m_Localized: That's all. Fight freely and defeat the enemy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
